  "$comment": "Docs audit budgets (specs/audit.feature). Scores are 0..1; bytes are transferred bytes, with room for the Latin-ext font a page may fetch late. A page override below a default names the baseline it was measured at, so a later round can raise it. knownFailures and seo.known only shrink: a new failure fails the run. Performance floors are calibrated on GitHub's ubuntu-latest runners (median of 3), which score 5 to 10 points below a laptop; raise them from the CI table after each performance round. agentReadiness.known shrinks the same way (specs/agent-readiness.feature); pageTokens counts characters / 4.",
